  "definition": "Administrative Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-11-16",
  "historyNote": "#1914, eff 2-1-82; ss by #3071, eff 7-25-85, EXPIRED: 7-25-91 New. #7762, eff 9-26-02; amd by #8210, eff 11-23-04; amd by #9795, INTERIM, eff 9-26-10, EXPIRES: 3-25-11; ss by #9894-A, eff 3-25-11; ss by #12742, INTERIM, eff 3-20-19, EXPIRED: 9-16-19 New. #12916, eff 11-16-19",
